@@ -0,0 +1,93 @@
+---
+title: 'Before-you-start copy revision + global em-dash ban'
+type: 'chore'
+created: '2026-08-05'
+status: 'in-review'
+baseline_commit: 'e0c4d8945f104cf871bb5f94e7bf957a828756fc'
+review_loop_iteration: 0
+---
+
+<frozen-after-approval reason="human-owned intent — do not modify unless human renegotiates">
+
+## Intent
+
+**Problem:** The public application funnel's "Before you start" checklist and guarantor trigger notes carry copy the user has replaced with final, user-ruled wording; separately, the user has declared a GLOBAL ban on em-dashes in any user-facing string (form, emails, and app copy alike).
+
+**Approach:** Land the user's verbatim 6-item checklist and student trigger note on every surface that renders them (SSR prep block, invite/auto-reply/reminder emails), then sweep every user-facing string in the product — server form/email/auth/legal/content copy, client dashboard copy, static JS — replacing each em-dash with a comma, colon, parenthesis, or sentence break as the context demands.
+
+## Boundaries & Constraints
+
+**Always:**
+- The 6 checklist items and the student trigger note are VERBATIM — no rewording, no punctuation changes inside them.
+- Never-rented / unemployed trigger notes mirror the student note's exact shape ("X, you'll need a guarantor: someone 18+ with a steady, verifiable income who agrees to back you. We'll ask for their details in the Guarantor step.") with their own lead-in.
+- Zero em-dashes in any string rendered to a user. Code comments and log/console strings keep their dashes.
+- Em-dash replacements are typographic only: comma, colon, parenthesis, or sentence break. No meaning changes, no copy rewrites beyond the dash.
+- Checklist item 3 (guarantor) and item 6 (save-as-you-go) must stay in sync across the SSR prep block, the email checklist (entity-encoded mirror), and form_draft.js.
+
+**Ask First:** nothing — all decisions user-ruled or mechanical.
+
+**Never:**
+- No rewording of any user-facing copy beyond dash replacement (except the verbatim items).
+- No changes to log messages, Sentry strings, or code comments.
+- No DB/API/schema changes; no migrations; no Squirrel runs.
+- No merging the PR.
+
+## I/O & Edge-Case Matrix
+
+| Scenario | Input / State | Expected Output / Behavior | Error Handling |
+|----------|--------------|---------------------------|----------------|
+| Checklist surfaces | SSR prep block, email `requirements_checklist_html` | 6 items verbatim incl. item 6 as a list item; no em-dashes | n/a |
+| F3 prep-note seam | prep-note `<p>` superseded by item 6 | Paragraph removed; form_draft.js note-swap removed (guarded code already tolerates absence); continue-link injection untouched | n/a |
+| Trigger notes | student/never-rented/unemployed selections | Exact student copy; same-shape siblings; no em-dashes | n/a |
+| Placeholder dashes | `"—"` used as empty-value marker (score cells, AI report) | Replaced with `"-"` | n/a |
+| Label joins | `"X — Y"` in error banners, evidence humanize, email bodies | `"X: Y"` or sentence break per context | n/a |
+
+## Code Map
+
+- `server/src/application/form_copy.gleam` — all form copy constants (22 `\u{2014}`), incl. `guarantor_checklist_item`, `guarantor_ahead_note_*`, `draft_prep_note`
+- `server/src/application/form_view.gleam` — SSR prep block (items, intro, prep-note) + title
+- `server/src/application/form_pages.gleam` — 404 titles, duplicate-submission line, error-banner label join
+- `server/src/application/error_summary.gleam` — field label map + indexed joins (23 literal `—`)
+- `server/src/application/form_sections/*.gleam` — references, tell_us_more, review_consent, guarantor surfaces
+- `server/src/application/application_handler.gleam` — 13 field-validation error strings
+- `server/src/application/document_upload.gleam`, `document_download_page.gleam`, `draft_view.gleam` — upload/erasure copy
+- `server/src/notification/email_client.gleam` + `notification_dispatch.gleam` — all templates (checklist, subjects, reminders, shortlist, verification)
+- `server/src/copy.gleam` — upload-surface helper copy
+- `server/src/consent/consent_handler.gleam`, `account/account_handler.gleam`, `auth/*` (auth_handler, settings_handler, supabase, password_reset_handler, csrf), `payment/payment_handler.gleam`, `erasure/erasure_view.gleam`, `response_helpers.gleam` — user-facing flash/error strings
+- `server/src/legal/**`, `server/src/content/*_view.gleam` — public legal/content pages
+- `server/src/ai/evidence_humanize.gleam`, `ai/audit_report.gleam` — AI-report text joins + placeholder
+- `client/src/copy.gleam`, `client/src/client.gleam`, `client/src/pages/*`, `client/src/components/*` — landlord dashboard copy (~140 strings + 9 `\u{2014}`)
+- `server/priv/static/form_draft.js`, `form_stepper.js` — mirrored user-facing strings
+- `shared/src/shared/policy_highlights.gleam` — 1 user-facing string
+- `server/test/**`, `client/test/**` — copy assertions to update
+- `.pi/skills/form-bug-hunt/scenarios/**`, `.pi/skills/bug-hunt/scenarios/**` — E2E assertions referencing changed strings
+
+## Tasks & Acceptance
+
+**Execution:**
+- [ ] `server/src/application/form_copy.gleam` -- replace checklist item 3 constant, 3 trigger notes, and all 22 em-dash constants; `draft_prep_note` becomes item-6 copy -- user-ruled copy + ban
+- [ ] `server/src/application/form_view.gleam` -- 6-item prep list, remove prep-note paragraph, de-dash intro/title -- checklist verbatim + ban
+- [ ] `server/src/notification/email_client.gleam` -- 6-item checklist (entity-encoded), drop trailing one-visit paragraph, de-dash all template strings + subjects -- checklist verbatim + ban
+- [ ] `server/priv/static/form_draft.js` + `form_stepper.js` -- sync mirrored strings, remove PREP_NOTE_SAVE swap -- keep-in-sync doctrine
+- [ ] Remaining server files (error_summary, form_pages, application_handler, form_sections/*, document_*, draft_view, copy.gleam, consent/account/auth/payment/erasure/response_helpers, legal/**, content/*, ai evidence/audit) -- sweep every user-facing `—`/`\u{2014}`/`&mdash;` -- global ban
+- [ ] `client/src/**` -- sweep copy.gleam, client.gleam, pages, components (incl. `"—"` placeholders → `"-"`) -- global ban
+- [ ] `shared/src/shared/policy_highlights.gleam` -- 1 string -- global ban
+- [ ] `server/test/**` + `client/test/**` -- update copy assertions -- tests green
+- [ ] `.pi/skills/*/scenarios/**` -- update E2E assertions on changed strings -- scenarios stay valid
+- [ ] Commit, push `form-copy-revision`, PR to `develop` with Decisions & rationale -- delivery
+
+**Acceptance Criteria:**
+- Given the /apply form, when rendered without JS, then the prep block lists exactly the user's 6 items verbatim and no prep-note paragraph follows.
+- Given the invite/auto-reply/reminder emails, when sent, then the checklist block contains the same 6 items verbatim and no em-dash in any template.
+- Given a student/never-rented/unemployed applicant, when the trigger choice is made, then the ahead-note shows the exact student copy or its same-shape sibling, em-dash-free.
+- Given `rg` over user-facing copy (all of server/src, client/src, priv/static JS), when scanning for `—`, `\u{2014}`, and `&mdash;`, then zero hits remain; every surviving literal em-dash sits in a comment or log string (listed in the PR).
+- Given `make format && make test && make build`, then all three pass.
+- Given the PR, when opened, then it carries a Decisions & rationale section and is never merged by the agent.
+
+## Verification
+
+**Commands:**
+- `make format && make test && make build` -- all green
+- `rg -n '\\u\{2014\}|&mdash;' server/src client/src server/priv/static shared/src --glob '*.{gleam,js}'` -- every hit is a comment/log, justified in PR
